[0.118, "o", "\u001b[1m=== ADR-0116: sandbox residency and pre-binding ===\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mA turn costs 2-9% of one core; almost all of it is waiting on the model.\r\nWhat costs time is STARTING a conversation, and what costs capacity is\r\nholding a sandbox after one ENDS. This measures both.\r\nCluster: fake model, no observability stack, 8-slot sandbox quota.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.212, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m[1/5] Today: a new conversation on a quiet node\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mthe claim carries the bundle ref as per-claim env, so the pod is built from scratch\u001b[0m\r\n"]
